legacy-computing-sprites

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Draw block mosaics that block-character images and TUIs use as shapes that fill their cell, as Ghostty does: sextants, octants, smooth mosaics, eighth blocks, braille, box diagonals and corner triangles. Font glyphs for these leave seams or are missing.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream herdr-app draws these ranges as sprites.
